# Lockfiles are intentionally not shared between machines here: native
# binaries (esbuild, rollup) are platform-specific, and a lockfile generated
# on one OS can break `npm install` on another. Let each machine resolve its
# own. Remove these two lines if the whole team is on the same OS and you'd
# rather pin exact versions.
package-lock.json

